{"Blacklist check compares mixed-case guest email against lowercased blacklistedGuestEmails, allowing blacklisted emails with different casing to bypass the check - need to lowercase guest before comparison": 0.9792368412017822, "isTeamAdminOrOwner uses && instead of || operator, requiring user to be both team admin AND team owner instead of either, incorrectly denying access to valid team admins or owners": 0.9778106212615967, "sendAddGuestsEmails sends emails without checking eventTypeDisableHostEmail() or eventTypeDisableAttendeeEmail(), causing emails to be sent even when event type has metadata.disableStandardEmails configured": 0.9561920762062073, "this.calEvent.attendees[0].name is accessed without checking if attendees array is non-empty, causing TypeError when attendees is empty": 0.947756826877594, "Fallback message t(\"unable_to_add_guests\") is unreachable because template literal always produces truthy string even when err.data?.code is undefined, resulting in \"undefined: ...\" instead of user-friendly default": 0.987967848777771, "Using array index as React key causes focus jumps and value misplacement when emails are removed from the middle of the list - should use stable unique identifiers instead": 0.9291079044342041}